     "mechanism-only. Post-allocation, per-basic-block only; ADRs deny wall-clock/Rust-parity claims."]
    ["Allocator-explicit AArch64 self-reentry (ADR 0276)"
     "mechanism-only. Sealed competitive timing rejected by host-load gate."]
    ["MADD/MSUB / Mersenne strength-reduction (codegen-coscientist 16–18; kotoba-native #83)"
     "mechanism-only. Context-gated; host-local numbers not universal %."]
    ["SIMD spill parking (codegen-coscientist 23–24; kotoba-native #86)"
     "mechanism-only. AArch64 leaf 1–16 spill slots park in caller-saved SIMD."]
    ["POSIX string equality SIMD (ADR 0283)"
     "mechanism-only. 16-byte NEON or SSE2 + scalar tail; Windows unchanged; latency rank pending."]
    ["Fuel/admission ceilings (ADR 0332, 0333)"
     "mechanism-only. Declared fuel, max-functions 1024, vector caps."]
    ["Target-locked worker + caches"
     "mechanism-only. Documented in docs/performance.md."]
    ["Accelerator workgroup/op set (accelerator.cljc; ADR 0002)"
     "mechanism-only. f32 elementwise + reduce; workgroup ≤1024."]
    ["[:slice T] bulk carrier (ADR 0285)"
     "design mechanism-only; implementation HOLD."]
    ["NEON guest reduction / vectorized deep-spill reduce (iter 28)"
     "not taken; not-applicable."]
    ["Absent emit targets"
     "not-applicable. Cerebras; HIP/ROCm; Vulkan/SPIR-V/PTX as shipped KIR."]]}
  {:title "When the unit is wrong"
   :paragraphs
   ["Measured economics. These numbers help choose host-side buffers or a future slice — not a slogan."
    "Native vector-at vs C -O3 on M1 Max (ADR 0284): 6.920 vs 0.329 ns/element → 21.1×; loop-only 11.2×; marginal context call 3.242 ns; perfgate qualified."
    "Capacity pins: arena 65536 words; vector cap 16384; handles 4096."
    "wasm32 crossings (ADR 0285): self-recursion 2.032 vs loop/recur 1.032 crossings/element."
    "Quiet-host levi on M4 (ADR 0285): wasm loop/recur 0.2371 ns/el vs C 0.2390 — do NOT read as amu=C."
    "[:slice T] load marginal: not separated from noise; slice not implemented."]}
