   :paragraphs
   ["Site fetched 2026-09-10. CPU/Wasm only. No GPU rank."
    "Native suite: Amu 19/30 pairs; quiet-host PASSED 2026-09-07; fastest-everywhere withheld; ≥2 unwinnable pairs."
